  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere (Additional Limbs) or multiple heads.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you have more than one head and are the target of a mind-affecting ability that allows a Will save, you may spend a spell point as a free action, even if it is not your turn, to reroll the save after the die is rolled but before the result is revealed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc101\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
